<section class="route practice-page" data-practice data-route-view data-route-key="practice" aria-label="Forward paper trading workspace">
  <header class="practice-heading"><div><span class="practice-eyebrow">PAPER TRADING / LIVE PRICES</span><h1>Real markets. Room to practice.</h1><p>Watch current market prices, place virtual orders, and see how your ideas unfold from this moment forward.</p></div><div class="workspace-actions"><a class="btn" href="/practice/polymarket" data-nav-link>Prediction paper bot ↗</a><a class="btn" href="/practice/equities" data-nav-link>Equity paper trading ↗</a></div></header>
  <div class="practice-boundary"><span class="practice-dot"></span><strong>Virtual funds only</strong><span>Prices come from live public feeds. Paper orders, balances, and results stay separate from your connected accounts.</span></div>
  <div class="workspace-tabs practice-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Paper trading tools"><button type="button" role="tab" id="practice-tab-paper" aria-controls="practice-panel-paper" aria-selected="true" data-practice-tab="paper">Paper accounts</button><button type="button" role="tab" id="practice-tab-data" aria-controls="practice-panel-data" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" data-practice-tab="data">Live market data</button></div>
  <p class="practice-feedback" role="status" data-practice-feedback>Loading your paper workspace…</p>
  <div class="practice-workspace"><section class="practice-primary">
    <section role="tabpanel" id="practice-panel-paper" aria-labelledby="practice-tab-paper" data-practice-panel="paper"><div class="practice-section-heading"><div><h2>Your paper accounts</h2><p>Every account starts now, with its own virtual cash and trade history.</p></div><button class="btn" type="button" data-practice-action="refresh">Refresh accounts</button></div><div class="practice-books" data-practice-books></div></section>
    <section role="tabpanel" id="practice-panel-data" aria-labelledby="practice-tab-data" data-practice-panel="data" hidden>
      <div class="practice-section-heading"><div><h2>Read the live market</h2><p>Discover instruments, check a current quote, and inspect its source and observation time.</p></div></div>
      <form class="practice-card" data-practice-data-form><label class="field">What would you like to inspect?<select name="method"><option value="quote">Current quote</option><option value="discover">Discover markets</option><option value="weather">Weather forecast</option><option value="wallet">Public wallet</option><option value="scanSolana">Screen a Solana token</option></select></label><div class="practice-form-grid">
        <label class="field">Market source<select name="source"><option value="binance">Crypto · Binance public feed</option><option value="polymarket">Prediction markets · Polymarket</option></select></label><label class="field">Symbol or outcome token<input name="instrument" value="BTCUSDT" placeholder="BTCUSDT"></label><label class="field">Market ID (Polymarket)<input name="marketId" placeholder="Market ID from discovery"></label><label class="field">Outcome<select name="outcomeIndex"><option value="0">First outcome (usually Yes / Up)</option><option value="1">Second outcome (usually No / Down)</option></select></label><label class="field">Search markets<input name="query" maxlength="100" placeholder="Search the current market sample"></label><label class="field">Public wallet or token address<input name="address" placeholder="Public address"></label><label class="field">Token screening profile<select name="profile"><option value="strict">Strict liquidity and activity</option><option value="smaller-pools">Smaller pools</option></select></label><label class="field">Latitude<input name="latitude" type="number" min="-90" max="90" step="any" placeholder="41.88"></label><label class="field">Longitude<input name="longitude" type="number" min="-180" max="180" step="any" placeholder="-87.63"></label><label class="field">Settlement station ID<input name="station" maxlength="20" placeholder="KORD"></label><label class="field">Forecast date<input name="date" type="date"></label><label class="field">Station time zone<input name="timezone" maxlength="80" value="UTC"></label>
      </div><p class="practice-help">Public quotes need no account key. Forecasts, wallet results, and indicative pool prices are evidence, not executable quotes. Advanced strategies wait when required evidence is missing.</p><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Fetch current data</button></form>
      <div class="practice-card" data-practice-data-result hidden><h3>Source response</h3><p data-practice-data-summary></p><div data-practice-data-preview></div><div class="workspace-actions"><button class="btn" type="button" data-practice-action="use-feed">Use this market for paper trading</button><button class="btn" type="button" data-practice-action="export-data">Download evidence</button></div><details><summary>Inspect full source evidence</summary><pre data-practice-data-json></pre></details></div>
      <%- include('../partials/reference-feed', { referenceMode: 'practice' }) %>
    </section>
    <section class="practice-card practice-report" data-practice-report hidden aria-label="Paper trading results"><div class="practice-section-heading"><h2 data-practice-report-title>Paper results</h2><button class="btn" type="button" data-practice-action="export">Download results</button></div><p data-practice-report-note></p><div class="practice-metrics" data-practice-metrics></div><div data-practice-chart></div><div data-practice-qa></div><h3>Open virtual positions</h3><div class="practice-scroll" data-practice-positions></div><h3>Virtual trade ledger</h3><div class="practice-scroll" data-practice-ledger></div><details><summary>Recent decisions and market evidence</summary><div data-practice-decisions></div></details></section>
  </section>
  <aside class="practice-card practice-builder" aria-label="Create a paper account"><span class="practice-eyebrow">START FORWARD TESTING</span><h2>Set up a paper account</h2><form data-practice-strategy-form>
    <label class="field">Trading approach<select name="strategyId" data-practice-strategy required></select></label><p class="practice-help" data-practice-strategy-description></p><label class="field">Account name<input name="name" maxlength="80" value="My paper account" required></label>
    <div class="practice-form-grid"><label class="field">Starting virtual cash ($)<input name="initialCapital" type="number" min="10" max="1000000" value="500" required></label><label class="field">Maximum entry ($)<input name="positionUsd" type="number" min="1" max="100000" value="25" required></label></div>
    <fieldset class="practice-feed-fields"><legend>Choose a live public feed</legend><label class="field">Source<select name="feedSource" required><option value="binance">Crypto · Binance public feed</option><option value="polymarket">Prediction markets · Polymarket</option></select></label><label class="field">Symbol or outcome token<input name="feedInstrument" value="BTCUSDT" placeholder="BTCUSDT" required></label><label class="field" data-practice-feed-market>Market ID (Polymarket)<input name="feedMarketId" placeholder="Market ID from discovery"></label><label class="field" data-practice-feed-outcome>Outcome<select name="feedOutcome"><option value="0">First outcome</option><option value="1">Second outcome</option></select></label><button class="btn" type="button" data-practice-action="discover">Discover markets ↗</button><p class="practice-help">Choose a market and outcome from live results to fill its identifiers automatically.</p></fieldset>
    <div data-practice-feed-fields hidden></div><details data-practice-rules><summary>Strategy rules</summary><div data-practice-strategy-fields></div><p class="practice-help" data-practice-required-signals></p></details>
    <details><summary>Risk limits and simulation costs</summary><div class="practice-form-grid"><label class="field">Maximum exposure (%)<input name="maxExposurePercent" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="50" required></label><label class="field">Open position limit<input name="maxPositions" type="number" min="1" max="30" value="5" required></label><label class="field">Pause entries at drawdown (%)<input name="maxDrawdownPercent" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="20" required></label><label class="field">Extra simulation fee (%)<input name="feePercent" type="number" min="0" max="5" step="0.01" value="0.1" required></label><label class="field">Slippage (%)<input name="slippagePercent" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.01" value="0.1" required></label></div><p class="practice-help">Any recorded provider fee is included in addition to these simulation costs.</p></details>
    <p class="practice-help">Create the account, then start its live feed. Every paper order fetches a current server-verified quote; no real funds are used.</p><button class="btn primary practice-submit" type="submit" data-practice-submit disabled>Create paper account</button>
  </form><div class="practice-reference"><strong>A separate place to practice</strong><p>Manual orders and automated strategies share the same virtual ledger, current-quote checks, and risk limits.</p></div></aside></div>
</section>
